 N(5,"SH3-03","سرعت‌سنج","sor'at-sanj","speedometer","سرعت‌سنج سرعت خودرو را نشان می‌دهد.","Sor'at-sanj sor'at-e khodro rā neshān midahad.","The speedometer shows the vehicle's speed.");
