 N(18,"SH3-06","نوش جان","nush-e jān","enjoy your meal; bon appétit","عبارت تعارف — set expression","میزبان گفت: نوش جان!","Mizbān goft: nush-e jān!","The host said, “Enjoy your meal!”");
 N(18,"SH3-06","سبزی‌پلو با ماهی","sabzi-polo bā māhi","herbed rice with fish","در شب عید سبزی‌پلو با ماهی می‌خوریم.","Dar shab-e Eid sabzi-polo bā māhi mikhorim.","We eat herbed rice with fish on the eve of the festival.");
 N(18,"SH3-06","زرشک‌پلو","zereshk-polo","barberry rice","زرشک‌پلو یکی از غذاهای محبوب ایرانی است.","Zereshk-polo yeki az ghazāhā-ye mahbub-e Irāni ast.","Barberry rice is a popular Iranian dish.");
 N(18,"SH3-06","چلوماهیچه","chelo-māhiche","rice with lamb shank","در مهمانی چلوماهیچه سفارش دادند.","Dar mehmāni chelo-māhiche sefāresh dādand.","They ordered rice with lamb shank at the gathering.");
 N(18,"SH3-06","سیستم تهویه","sistem-e tahviye","ventilation system","سیستم تهویهٔ رستوران هوای تازه فراهم می‌کند.","Sistem-e tahviye-ye restoran havā-ye tāze farāham mikonad.","The restaurant's ventilation system provides fresh air.");
 N(18,"SH3-06","قورمه‌سبزی","qorme-sabzi","ghormeh sabzi (Persian herb stew)","قورمه‌سبزی از غذاهای معروف ایران است.","Qorme-sabzi az ghazāhā-ye ma'ruf-e Irān ast.","Ghormeh sabzi is a well-known Iranian dish.");
 N(18,"SH3-06","شمارهٔ اشتراک","shomāre-ye eshterāk","subscription number","برای دریافت خدمات، شمارهٔ اشتراک را اعلام کنید.","Barāye daryāft-e khadamāt, shomāre-ye eshterāk rā e'lām konid.","Give your subscription number to receive the service.");
 N(19,"SH3-07","تعمیر جزئی","ta'mir-e jozi","minor repair","هتل برای تعمیر جزئی اتاق اقدام کرد.","Hotel barāye ta'mir-e jozi-ye otāq eqdām kard.","The hotel arranged a minor repair.");
 N(19,"SH3-07","اختلال در شبکه","ekhtelāl dar shabake","network disruption","اختلال در شبکه باعث قطع ارتباط شد.","Ekhtelāl dar shabake bā'es-e qat'-e ertebāt shod.","A network disruption caused the connection to fail.");
 N(19,"SH3-07","مخابرات","mokhāberāt","telecommunications","کارکنان با شرکت مخابرات تماس گرفتند.","Kārkonān bā sherkat-e mokhāberāt tamās gereftand.","The staff contacted the telecommunications company.");
 N(19,"SH3-07","سوئیت","su'it","suite","برای خانواده یک سوئیت رزرو کردیم.","Barāye khānevāde yek su'it rezerv kardim.","We booked a suite for the family.");
 N(19,"SH3-07","مسافرخانه","mosāfer-khāne","guesthouse; budget inn","مسافرخانه نزدیک ایستگاه قرار دارد.","Mosāfer-khāne nazdik-e istgāh qarār dārad.","The guesthouse is near the station.");
 N(19,"SH3-07","سونا","sonā","sauna","هتل یک سونا و استخر دارد.","Hotel yek sonā va estakhr dārad.","The hotel has a sauna and a swimming pool.");
